The first implementation is in place. Its certificates are generated entirely by construction, and the checker reconstructs both complementary cycle covers without consulting the planted answer. The initial full self-test is computationally heavier than expected because it performs 200,000 structure-aware guesses plus exact cycle checks; I’m profiling that now and will optimize only the measurement path, not weaken the gate.
