- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1901.09651/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The result is not yet ship-certified: the required four-vendor hardening runs received HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” from OpenRouter before any scored attempt. The error transcripts were preserved and not misreported as model failures. Once quota is restored, rerun:

```bash
python3 ../../scripts/harden.py gen_1901_09651.py
```

The construction follows the complementary-tour condition and directed perfect-matching reduction in the [source paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.09651).
