codex
A viable honest family is Track B. The certificate is the paper’s directed perfect-matching/cycle-cover choice, encoded as a bounded binary selector. The construction makes valid selectors exponentially sparse, while a generic best-improvement version of the paper’s component-count energy still solves the generated distribution in polynomial time; the intended shortcut is to recognize a hidden chord-intersection pairing. I’ll implement and measure both routes, explicitly reporting the efficient reference algorithm rather than treating it as a failed attack.
